            "type": "paragraph",
            "location": {
              "line": 3,
              "heading": "Flying with Children on CloudWay 24"
            },
            "text": "Traveling with young passengers? At CloudWay 24, we strive to make your journey as seamless and comfortable as possible for families and children of all ages. Here’s everything you need to know about flying with children on our network."
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "Pre-flight Preparation",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 7,
              "heading": "Flying with Children on CloudWay 24"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 9,
                  "heading": "Pre-flight Preparation"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Booking for Children",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Children under 2 years: Can travel as infants on lap or with a booked seat (additional charges may apply).",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Children aged 2–12 years: Require their own seat and are eligible for child fares.",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unaccompanied Minors: Special handling and escort services available for children aged 5–12 flying alone. Request while booking.",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Special Requests",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Bassinet: Request for infants (subject to availability and aircraft type).",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Child Meals: Pre-book child-friendly meals at least 24 hours before departure via “Manage My Flight.”",
                    "depth": 1
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Seating Preferences: Request seats together for families to ensure peace of mind.",
                    "depth": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
